              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'>: </run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'>The formula for &apos;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffed99'>Automation %</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'>&apos; used in this tab is</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
